149
00:08:53,580 --> 00:08:55,420
Normally you'd go off to do
photo booths or something.

150
00:08:55,420 --> 00:08:57,260
So why aren't you doing that today?

151
00:08:57,700 --> 00:08:59,480
Like reading sports papers at a café,

152
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:00,920
