153
00:09:00,920 --> 00:09:02,740
There's plenty of other things to do,
normally.

154
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:04,900
Doing that every day,

155
00:09:04,900 --> 00:09:06,660
I think only you do that, senpai.

156
00:09:06,660 --> 00:09:08,060
This won't make an article.

157
00:09:10,880 --> 00:09:12,120
Shutter chance!

158
00:09:13,460 --> 00:09:14,140
Yes!

159
00:09:14,140 --> 00:09:15,360
