what are you going to do with panty shots?

161
00:09:18,860 --> 00:09:20,680
With this, I've got the upper hand.

162
00:09:20,680 --> 00:09:23,620
The preparations are complete,
and now behold the finishing touch.

163
00:09:23,620 --> 00:09:25,361
Well, the rest is up to
the great editor-in-chief,

164
00:09:25,411 --> 00:09:27,740
