168
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:41,620
Wow, that's incredible.

169
00:09:41,620 --> 00:09:42,680
I-I can't take it.

170
00:09:48,220 --> 00:09:50,220
You're a goner too, you know.

171
00:09:50,220 --> 00:09:51,960
I'll pay you, so please sell it to me.

172
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:54,720
We still have newspapers, so please line up.

173
00:09:55,140 --> 00:09:56,560
Line up, line up.

174
00:09:56,560 --> 00:09:58,360
The popularity is beyond expectations.

175
00:09:58,360 --> 00:10:02,920
They're really great,
these two are great, wonderful.

176
00:10:02,920 --> 00:10:06,960
Oh really? To me they just look
