220
00:11:37,420 --> 00:11:40,140
I just happened to pick it up
when it was lying in the hallway.

221
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:44,400
Anyway, one police station
doesn't need two newsletters!

222
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:48,060
But we have to hear their side too,
don't we?

223
00:11:51,160 --> 00:11:54,700
